        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Edge's privacy preserving ads API never shipped]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29723</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29723"/>
        <updated>2026-05-21T16:32:47.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">As best as I can tell, Edge's variation on Google's protected audience API never shipped and was gated behind a flag. This will make removal dates make more sense.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">See this blog post: <a href="https://blogs.windows.com/msedgedev/2024/03/05/new-privacy-preserving-ads-api/" rel="nofollow">https://blogs.windows.com/msedgedev/2024/03/05/new-privacy-preserving-ads-api/</a> and the discussion on <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2845705770" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/2635" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635/hovercard" href="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635">web-platform-dx/web-features#2635</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This was never quite the same as protected audience, but it shared some of the same surface area.</p>
<p dir="auto">Also, it's slated for removal (like Google's API); see <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2845705770" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/2635" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635/hovercard?comment_id=3971985214&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635#issuecomment-3971985214">web-platform-dx/web-features#2635 (comment)</a>.</p>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2845705770" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/2635" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635/hovercard" href="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635">web-platform-dx/web-features#2635</a></li>
</ul>

]]></content>
