    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Reconcile Safari `Reporting-Endpoints` `default` data]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29720</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29720"/>
        <updated>2026-05-21T10:12:44.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This is my goof, with a bad review on <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4322601139" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29539" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29539/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29539">#29539</a>.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Safari doesn't support any of the report types that are known to use <code class="notranslate">default</code>, so I don't think Safari actually does anything with <code class="notranslate">default</code>. This also reconciles the support data with <code class="notranslate">api.ReportingObserver.ReportingObserver.options_parameter.types_property.deprecation</code>.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">Safari has open bugs for deprecation and crash reporting along with concerns on the relevant standards positions issues. There's no good evidence that they implemented anything here, even behind a flag.</p>
<p dir="auto">It's probably just a bad copy and paste from the ancestor features, which I ought to have caught reviewing <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4322601139" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29539" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29539/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29539">#29539</a>. Oops!</p>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Previously: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4322601139" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29539" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29539/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29539">#29539</a></li>
<li>Bug: <a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=269925" rel="nofollow">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=269925</a></li>
<li>Bug: <a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=244899" rel="nofollow">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=244899</a></li>
<li>Standards position: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1364962655" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/59" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/59/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/59">WebKit/standards-positions#59</a></li>
<li>Standards position: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2834197911" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/456" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/456/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/456">WebKit/standards-positions#456</a></li>
</ul>

]]></content>
